y as a ray, there is only one intersection.)\n\n**(Ⅱ)** Since \\(\\rho^2\\cos2\\theta=x^2-y^2\\), curve \\(C_1\\) is\n\\[\nx^2-y^2=8.\n\\]\nSubstituting the parametrized line gives\n\\[\n\\left(2+\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}t\\right)^2-\\left(\\frac t2\\right)^2=8\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\nt^2+4\\sqrt3\\,t-8=0.\n\\]\nThus \\(t_M,t_N=-2\\sqrt3\\pm2\\sqrt5\\). The direction vector \\((\\sqrt3/2,1/2)\\) has unit length, hence\n\\[\nMN=|t_M-t_N|=4\\sqrt5.\n\\]\n\nFinal answer: (Ⅰ) \\(A=(4,\\pi/6)\\), \\(B=(-4,\\pi/6)\\) in signed-radius coordinates; (Ⅱ) \\(MN=4\\sqrt5\\)."}],"phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":"24h","reasoning":{"context":"all_turns","effort":"medium","mode":"standard","summary":null},"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","store":false,"temperature":1,"text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"medium"},"tool_choice":"auto","tool_usage":{"image_gen":{"input_tokens":0,"input_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"total_tokens":0},"web_search":{"num_requests":0}},"tools":[],"top_logprobs":0,"top_p":0.98,"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":239,"input_tokens_details":{"cache_write_tokens":0,"cached_tokens":0},"output_tokens":530,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":158},"total_tokens":769},"user":null,"metadata":{}}
